    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 2 — Shaman</strong></p><p><strong>“You can ask now. That doesn’t mean the answer will be polite.”</strong></p><p>At Tier 2, you stop merely perceiving living systems and begin negotiating with them. A storm can be persuaded to pass slightly east. A treeline can hide you if it likes your reasons. The road does not get easier. It gets more willing.</p><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Strategic Turn, when your faction faces travel hazard, severe weather, or terrain-based difficulty, choose one:</li><ul><li>reduce the severity of one weather or terrain complication by one step, <em>or</em></li><li>gain <strong>Advantage</strong> on one relevant travel or wilderness-facing Strategic Roll</li></ul></ul><p><strong>Additional Benefit:</strong> when planning movement through hostile terrain, the GM should treat your faction as unusually competent at reading the path of least spiritual resistance.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> every favor asked of the land becomes a relationship to maintain. Expect localized spirits, weather memory, or ecological resentment if your faction takes the benefit without reciprocity.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"shamT2\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Read the Path</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Strategic Turn &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Reduce one weather/terrain complication by one step OR reroll the lowest die on one travel/wilderness Strategic Roll.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
